# spec: gate-sdk/SPEC.md §check-script-preflight — this repo's script rules. Several sessions share one tree, so a kill by name or pattern reaches another session's processes: a script kills a child by parent pid or by an exact quoted name, never more broadly.
waiver-min 5

rule KILL-BROAD command
  cmd pkill
  allow ^pkill -P "[$][{]?[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*[}]?"$
  allow ^pkill -x ("[^"$`]+"|'[^']+')$
  waiver kill-ok
